    "long_instructions": "## First Click!\r\n\r\nCode a complete interaction for one button, including selecting an element, adding an event listener, and updating the text box on screen when the user clicks. \r\n\r\nYou may use **AI** for explanations and hints but you should write the code yourself.\r\n\r\nTest your code and use your **debugging checklist** to assist with any errors. Use AI to help clarify errors, if necessary. ",
